     #### 1. Low Operational[0m[2m Complexity and Team Familiarity
     We already run and maintain Redis in our production environment for session management and rate limiting. Choosing[0m[2m Redis Streams introduces zero new infrastructure components. Our 6-person team does not have a dedicated DevOps engineer, meaning any[0m[2m new complex technology like Kafka would impose a continuous operational tax on our senior developers. Reusing Redis eliminates the steep learning curve[0m[2m, new monitoring configurations, and provisioning pipelines.
     
